{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "a49d0d80cce448707bf689a7a6e18b67f39368310e9a9b6a05953271aa4051cd", "ja": "オフショット☆素顔の魔法少女たち", "zh": "花絮照☆素颜的魔法少女们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a2d78041c628b99793f7e8969f4290f21e7a0f72d100f91f2f57fc94cba979ca", "ja": "イベントに続いて、リバイバル公演を無事に\n成功させた育、百合子、亜利沙。見に来てい\nたひなたや春香に褒められ、亜利沙は気絶。\nしばらくして目を覚ました亜利沙は、感謝の\n言葉と共に公演の動画を要求するのだった。", "zh": "继活动之后，育、百合子和亚利沙顺利完成了复出演出。受到前来观看的日向和春香夸奖后，亚利沙激动得昏了过去。过了一会儿醒来的亚利沙，向她们道谢的同时，还要求提供演出的视频。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "69a1152822abd67a5fb9123036da55914147cc4c9be8b63b7faff25c93712749", "ja": "（トゥインクルリズムのリバイバル公演は無事終了！\n終わった後も、大歓声と拍手は続いていたな）", "zh": "（Twinkle Rhythm的复出演出顺利结束了！演出结束后，观众的欢呼声和掌声仍在持续呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "eb73dd4ae58b2a82c8c3728216afb7f22abd82d3a0db55fe40ac50cdebd1dbd8", "ja": "{$P$}さーん！\nどうだった？　わたし達の公演！", "zh": "{$P$}先生——！\n觉得怎么样？我们的演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "efaf17bbed030ea8ff0e317d17b2c177dbadbdf83a1f9ced416b1bc095d22b57", "ja": "お疲れ様。すごく良いステージだった！\n曲の前にいれた殺陣もとても見ごたえがあったよ。", "zh": "辛苦了。真是一场精彩的演出！\n歌曲开始前加入的武打表演也非常值得一看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "e196c277856e9a40b3a528b780f996f703593582d136511de269d3268510ab39", "ja": "よかった～。曲より殺陣の練習の方が大変だったけど。\n頑張った甲斐があったね、育ちゃん！", "zh": "太好了～。虽然杀阵的练习比歌曲还辛苦，但努力没有白费呢，育！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "7d6955af3069e9180102a7f8796e5451c60f0cdfb23696210419a3257a9b5e74", "ja": "うん！　それに、お母さんと一緒にきたよって\n人もいっぱいいて、うれしかったなぁ♪", "zh": "嗯！而且，还有好多和妈妈一起来的人，我也觉得好开心呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "6509d187d87ad9285675b0370267e1d17a45ff7bb6a26d5e055089517bc1cebb", "ja": "小さい子がコンサートライトを振る姿が尊くて……\nううっ。ありさ、歌の途中で泣きそうになりました！", "zh": "小孩子挥舞荧光棒的样子太珍贵了……\n呜呜。亚利沙在唱歌中途都快哭出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "f17242211e230037d88da6d1f78b2035db1947b6f3f3c8e307661d07bdd0d7cb", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！　歌だけじゃなくて、\nお芝居もあって……盛りだくさんなステージだったね！", "zh": "大家辛苦啦！不仅有唱歌，\n还有短剧……真是内容好丰富的舞台呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "4715715fdb082ec7af286e246251b995abf64eaa44a33e333b8f47fd6250eaf1", "ja": "春香さんと一緒に見てたけども、\n3人もお客さんも、みーんなキラキラしてたよぉ。", "zh": "我和春香一起看着，3位客人，每一个都闪闪发光呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "b854072be18711adc18423e4ae2652d639dd38a0d85e6a56a4fee6387279141c", "ja": "えへへ～。春香さんやひなたちゃんに褒めてもらえる\nなんて……ありさ、頑張ってよかったですぅ！", "zh": "嘿嘿～能得到春香小姐和日向夸奖……亚利沙觉得努力果然没有白费呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "aacc256afb25975997e4f658b80a92d0a0eda1c2a4c8e0e4a8a019570fd83dd5", "ja": "うんうん、アザもたくさんできたって言ってたもんね。\n「アリサ、えらいっぴ！」……なんて♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，你不是说还留下了好多淤青嘛。  \n“亚利沙，真棒啵！”……之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "bc8e6608b48d4e4d2d99f4f71f31e90b98bb2cfaefb5c0a17a2a7a327bc1c02f", "ja": "ひゃああ！？　春香さんが、こんなに褒めてくれる\nなんて……む、ムフフフ……ムフーッ！！", "zh": "啊啊啊！？春香前辈居然会这么夸我……呜、嘿嘿嘿……嘿——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1011_se", "source_sha256": "edc80b7c0f11e7c6ff52471a4a2b5d06a0d283d07edde4c95186d5b6507c6933", "ja": "バターンッ！", "zh": "啪嗒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "b5bef19cfce6e4dec8dc5a81b122e09d4f0c493fa36455b1edaba8c5b5199a12", "ja": "わっ！　亜利沙さんが倒れちゃいました！\nでも、気を失ってるのにすごい笑顔……。", "zh": "哇！亚利沙倒下去了！\n不过，明明都失去意识了，笑容却好灿烂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "41978475123ab790ad4f930a57120e1420452df4b74926384170a17712d219fa", "ja": "亜利沙ちゃん！？\nわ、私、何か変なことしちゃった？？", "zh": "亚利沙！？\n我、我做了什么奇怪的事吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8bd12579d032b16105629fc377ff9bb136aa7ae99c22e8728b1ff27c22b33ed3", "ja": "いや、春香は何もしてないよ。\nとりあえず、亜利沙のことは任せてくれ。", "zh": "不是，春香什么都没做。\n总之，亚利沙就交给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "85abbe9c7cd8cee4a433a02f1ab80d59ef1814d27e37ac9d8e272f98418fd225", "ja": "風邪を引くといけないから、\n育と百合子は、先に着替えに行ってほしい。", "zh": "为了避免感冒，育和百合子先去换衣服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "9ce247e51956575d57f6bd5f41ea1f8cd5bac6fcb36efa565a2c26d548815080", "ja": "うん、わかった。{$P$}さん、\n亜利沙さんのこと、よろしくね？", "zh": "嗯，知道了。{$P$}先生，亜利沙就拜托你了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "6e9c40d49a8c0aaade70ebaedac3a0e3afef06b9ebfb526c59414d1bac35c680", "ja": "ここにいたら、片付けの邪魔になっちゃいそうだね。\nひなたちゃん。私達も控え室に行こうか？", "zh": "待在这里好像会妨碍收拾呢。\n日向，我们也去休息室吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "735692f2be015518a81a64dc08d339e0ce4eaeec48bfe562ee160154bad5c177", "ja": "そうだねぇ、春香さん。\nしたっけ{$P$}、後でねぇ。", "zh": "是呀，春香姐。那就……{$P$}，待会儿见哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "2d33909b729eb01b3b5d8dcb1253f99342b6ee6fc81c91e41340d18d70312bb1", "ja": "……ハッ！？！？　ここはドコですか！？\n天国ですか？　地獄ですか？", "zh": "……哈！？！？这里是哪里！？\n是天堂吗？还是地狱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "872bb6be6c37b9f4b40718726183309a204fb9635e012426eddea737fe49d2da", "ja": "ここは劇場だ。……春香に褒められて、\n気を失うなんて、余程嬉しかったんだな。", "zh": "这里是剧场。……被春香夸奖后，居然高兴得昏过去了，看来你是真的特别开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "34e1989c0a4c825abb85bc95e8f893ea065e305494f46261314558f32434b5ae", "ja": "そういえば途中から意識がありません……ヒィッ！\nありさは……ありさは、なんたる失態を！！", "zh": "说起来，我从中途开始就失去意识了……咿呀！\n亚利沙……亚利沙竟然犯下了如此失态的行为！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "ebe45ea56caf50082328b3283a0508c0527ff9a0bffd299f37985ce189e56bc4", "ja": "ほらほら、いいから。着替えに行こう。", "zh": "好啦好啦，别磨蹭了。我们去换衣服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "a85ad8efca4ed6c62ef01ab536794e3480202b5fc4532850c64d6351445ba17d", "ja": "あ、あの、{$P$}さん！\n……ありさ、嬉しかったです。", "zh": "啊，那个，{$P$}先生！\n……亚利沙很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "ee673b72b1404829236989b753be23c610b24a5ffa774801df723fe516dbb023", "ja": "公演もその前のイベントでも、アイドルちゃんが\nキラキラしてて、お客さんもみんな笑顔で……。", "zh": "不管是公演还是之前的活动，偶像们都闪闪发光，客人们也全都面带笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "6b61571fbbcd9ac79f48802eabe566fcd6bf2ab1298448d843d8e15ebe7f8e33", "ja": "育ちゃんや百合子ちゃん達と活動する機会を\n作ってくれて、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "谢谢您为我们创造了和育、百合子她们一起活动的机会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "5391b5cef3dd6640c990623be1b99e6db3df75206edea48aa1100e96d14b1fa1", "ja": "何を言ってるんだ。亜利沙やみんなが頑張ったから、\n今回の公演に繋がったんだ。こっちこそ、ありがとな。", "zh": "你在说什么呢。正因为有亚利沙和大家的努力，才促成了这次公演。该说谢谢的是我才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "3c357c53f04180b704ecb182af7ca2478b8b7bf0a98fdbac506fe6ed82ee5399", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nあの、ひとつお願いがあるんですケド……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n那个，我有一件事想拜托您……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "de45084e4f5c13026123031e336ad8e25343ecec0037e58023b9d847e6962b98", "ja": "お願い？", "zh": "请求？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "e1389af8170ab01e6f33a9ec49878980b85e61cdc3d63864a4c603a06683496f", "ja": "その……公演の動画はいつ見られるようになりますか？\nどーしても、もう一度見たいシーンがあるんですっ！", "zh": "那个……演出的录像什么时候能看呢？\n我无论如何都想再看一次那个场景！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "205b1bf9f11324c8f9bf7ef7be14676db9d57af51b951b8ccca3606608c50928", "ja": "育ちゃんの可愛い動きは、正面から見ておかないと。\nMCで噛んだ百合子ちゃんも確認したいところですね。", "zh": "育的可爱动作，不从正面看可不行。还想确认一下MC时说话结巴的百合子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "a452781463c8541578200ac5d3a78eb98aab528c47bb7ece4f1b4ee1cd123d09", "ja": "……えっと。\n多分、今日中には渡せる……かな？", "zh": "……那个。\n大概今天之内能交给你……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_05_1033_028ari", "source_sha256": "8394d2450a711c8a2431ddb1744f5629cfc8c115f0851c21f8aaa4b9eed5f99b", "ja": "わっかりましたー！\nそれじゃ、データができたら教えてください！", "zh": "明白啦！\n那么，数据做好后请告诉我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
